        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;eric_sse: publish-subscribe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffe6cc;border:1px solid #d79b00&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.connection&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#dae8fc;border:1px solid #6c8ebf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.entities&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;border:1px solid #d6b656&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.listener&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8cecc;border:1px solid #b85450&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.message&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#d5e8d4;border:1px solid #82b366&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.prefabs&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#e1d5e7;border:1px solid #9673a6&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; eric_sse.queues&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;solid, hollow triangle: extends&lt;br&gt;dashed, hollow triangle: implements an interface&lt;br&gt;filled diamond: composition (diamond on the owner)&lt;br&gt;hollow diamond: aggregation (diamond on the owner)&lt;br&gt;dashed, open arrow: «create» / uses&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt;: abstract, &lt;u&gt;underlined&lt;/u&gt;: static&lt;br&gt;dashed border: detailed in the other diagram&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reserved message types (eric_sse.entities):&lt;br&gt;MESSAGE_TYPE_CLOSED, MESSAGE_TYPE_END_OF_STREAM, MESSAGE_TYPE_INTERNAL_ERROR" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=8;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#ffffff;">
